(text "PS1 AV multi-out via a short pigtail to a multi-AV male plug (pinout in docs/design.md). Multi-out\n+5V (pin 3) and S-Video C (pin 6) are not carried." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a15fe88-542d-46d0-b039-834460bc7807"))
